osTicket on FenrirOS
====================

Code in /usr/share/osticket; its configuration file is
/etc/osticket/ost-config.php (include/ost-config.php links to it).

1. Create a MariaDB database and user for osTicket.
2. Make the configuration writable for the web installer:
     chown _php /etc/osticket/ost-config.php
3. nginx: /usr/share/doc/osticket/nginx-osticket.conf; enable php-fpm and nginx,
   then open http://<host>/setup/ and follow the installer.
4. Afterwards: chown root /etc/osticket/ost-config.php (read-only again),
   and remove /usr/share/osticket/setup if you like (osTicket asks for it).
5. Mail fetching and scheduled tasks: install the example cron job and
   enable crond:
     cp /usr/share/doc/osticket/osticket.cron /etc/cron.d/osticket
     dinitctl enable crond
